WEBVTT

00:02:00.030 --> 00:02:04.030
I heard a voice

00:02:19.480 --> 00:02:21.900
'n there...

00:02:47.570 --> 00:02:49.350
Shingo, is anything wrong?

00:02:53.530 --> 00:02:54.340
Shingo!

00:02:57.940 --> 00:02:59.040
No, nothing.

00:03:00.110 --> 00:03:00.770
Really...

00:03:02.720 --> 00:03:04.740
It's about time we stopped.

00:03:04.990 --> 00:03:07.460
I agree. We've made a lot of progress today.

00:04:12.600 --> 00:04:13.720
.emoC

00:04:30.730 --> 00:04:34.050
I'm planning to look around the Eastern Woods.

00:04:34.800 --> 00:04:35.910
The eastern woods?

00:04:36.340 --> 00:04:36.920
Yes.

00:04:37.240 --> 00:04:38.830
Why do you want to go there?

00:04:39.370 --> 00:04:41.530
We haven't gone there yet, and...

00:04:46.410 --> 00:04:47.720
...I heard a voice.

00:04:49.200 --> 00:04:50.270
That again?

00:04:51.320 --> 00:04:53.570
I heard it when we were attacked
by the giant lizard too...

00:04:53.740 --> 00:04:55.410
...and it had been on my mind ever since...

00:04:55.950 --> 00:04:58.740
...but this time, I got a feeling like
it was saying, "Come to me."

00:04:59.170 --> 00:05:01.970
Sounds great. Let's go exploring.

00:05:02.830 --> 00:05:03.750
No.

00:05:03.750 --> 00:05:05.120
I'm going on my own.

00:05:05.700 --> 00:05:07.120
It's dangerous on your own.

00:05:07.870 --> 00:05:09.990
If you were going, how many
people should go along?

00:05:10.480 --> 00:05:11.890
I'd be afraid.

00:05:12.090 --> 00:05:15.340
You never know what kind of
scary creature might attack you.

00:05:15.810 --> 00:05:18.090
The cowards can just mind the hearth.

00:05:18.210 --> 00:05:20.250
Wouldn't that mean you'd be stayin' home too?

00:05:20.790 --> 00:05:22.740
I'm not a coward or anything!

00:05:25.440 --> 00:05:27.470
In any event, we have to investigate it.

00:05:28.420 --> 00:05:29.250
I'll go.

00:05:31.050 --> 00:05:32.020
I'll go too.

00:05:32.640 --> 00:05:35.010
If Bell's coming along,
you have nothing to worry about.

00:05:35.530 --> 00:05:36.820
What's that supposed to mean?

00:05:36.920 --> 00:05:38.080
It means that.

00:05:38.080 --> 00:05:39.360
What?

00:05:41.400 --> 00:05:42.860
The eastern woods are deep.

00:05:43.390 --> 00:05:45.390
We'll have to build a raft somehow, won't we?

00:05:46.930 --> 00:05:49.310
If we use the bamboo,
we should be able to make one simply.

00:05:49.950 --> 00:05:51.580
Thank you, everyone.

00:06:26.040 --> 00:06:27.710
Alright! It's finished!

00:06:42.580 --> 00:06:43.350
Shingo!

00:06:45.730 --> 00:06:47.530
Sharla! Come here for a minute!

00:06:57.170 --> 00:06:58.200
Have you come to?

00:06:58.760 --> 00:06:59.850
You seem to be exhausted.

00:07:00.580 --> 00:07:01.760
Please take it easy for a while.

00:07:58.140 --> 00:08:00.510
Huh? That's strange...

00:08:00.750 --> 00:08:02.340
Fine, once more!

00:08:04.420 --> 00:08:06.510
Let's bring the map tomorrow and try to fill it in.

00:08:06.840 --> 00:08:08.080
Yes, let's do that.

00:08:16.200 --> 00:08:17.270
It's worthless.

00:08:26.340 --> 00:08:28.370
Hey, welcome back!

00:08:30.690 --> 00:08:31.420
We're home!

00:08:31.560 --> 00:08:32.920
Hey, you made a bow!

00:08:34.460 --> 00:08:37.990
Yeah, but it doesn't seem to be made that well...

00:09:12.130 --> 00:09:15.000
Well, there's two days worth of food in here.

00:09:15.210 --> 00:09:16.520
Thank you, Sharla.

00:09:18.300 --> 00:09:22.070
Be careful. If you come across
a scary creature, run away fast.

00:09:22.890 --> 00:09:23.700
Will do.

00:09:25.050 --> 00:09:27.170
We'll definitely be back tomorrow.

00:09:27.580 --> 00:09:29.380
Until then, take care of everyone.

00:09:30.150 --> 00:09:31.500
Right, I will.

00:09:32.230 --> 00:09:33.320
And also...

00:09:33.940 --> 00:09:35.680
Take care of Shingo as well.

00:09:37.710 --> 00:09:40.390
Come to think of it, he's the only
one who didn't come see us off.

00:09:40.890 --> 00:09:42.520
He's probably exhausted.

00:09:42.970 --> 00:09:45.220
He seemed to be in poor shape yesterday as well.

00:09:46.930 --> 00:09:50.100
Very well. I'll check in on him as much as I can.

00:09:51.190 --> 00:09:52.180
Well, see you later.

00:09:54.520 --> 00:09:56.440
Alright! Push us off, Bell.

00:09:58.590 --> 00:10:00.600
Luna! Take it easy!

00:10:00.920 --> 00:10:01.890
Come home soon.

00:10:02.550 --> 00:10:03.640
See you later!

00:10:16.540 --> 00:10:19.350
Be careful!

00:10:56.320 --> 00:10:57.580
This is the last of them.

00:11:02.060 --> 00:11:03.990
Shingo, where are you going?

00:11:06.490 --> 00:11:07.670
Just to the shuttle for a bit.

00:11:08.290 --> 00:11:10.650
Don't you think you should be resting today?

00:11:11.400 --> 00:11:13.440
I want to get the communications equipment.

00:11:14.740 --> 00:11:16.110
I thought you couldn't fix it.

00:11:16.720 --> 00:11:18.770
I want to give it another try.

00:11:19.260 --> 00:11:23.170
If we don't send out a rescue beacon,
we'll never be able to get home.

00:11:24.320 --> 00:11:26.680
Wait! It's dangerous to go alone!

00:11:27.130 --> 00:11:30.670
It's okay. If anything happens,
I'll worry about it then.

00:11:34.950 --> 00:11:36.470
Sharla, take care of the rest.

00:11:49.350 --> 00:11:51.320
It got like this...

00:11:55.820 --> 00:11:56.770
It's a tobihane!

00:11:57.620 --> 00:11:58.220
Hey!

00:11:58.440 --> 00:11:59.490
Look at that!

00:12:02.190 --> 00:12:03.860
Alright, with the bow I'll...

00:12:04.010 --> 00:12:05.490
Don't! Stay quiet!

00:12:16.930 --> 00:12:18.000
That's a relief.

00:12:22.200 --> 00:12:23.360
Do you hear something?

00:12:24.360 --> 00:12:26.100
Not that weird voice again.

00:12:30.410 --> 00:12:30.990
No...

00:12:32.020 --> 00:12:33.110
This sound is...

00:12:35.100 --> 00:12:35.870
...a waterfall!

00:12:35.870 --> 00:12:36.880
What did you say?

00:13:03.670 --> 00:13:04.650
It's a waterfall!

00:13:05.120 --> 00:13:06.170
What did you say?

00:13:07.050 --> 00:13:08.660
Right! Go to the right!

00:13:32.230 --> 00:13:33.230
Luna!

00:13:40.650 --> 00:13:42.130
I'm very happy, Luna.

00:13:42.470 --> 00:13:43.570
It's a very cute embroidery.

00:13:48.640 --> 00:13:49.560
Luna!

00:13:49.560 --> 00:13:50.400
Idiot, don't!

00:14:29.140 --> 00:14:30.110
Daddy!

00:14:31.390 --> 00:14:34.270
Daddy, happy birthday!

00:14:34.570 --> 00:14:35.940
Thanks, Luna.

00:14:37.420 --> 00:14:39.820
Ta-da! It's a cake!

00:14:41.320 --> 00:14:43.560
Me and Chako made it!

00:14:45.900 --> 00:14:47.420
This looks tasty!

00:14:47.940 --> 00:14:49.160
And also, here!

00:14:51.520 --> 00:14:56.120
I made an embroidery so
everyone can always be together.

00:14:59.340 --> 00:15:00.450
This backpack...

00:15:00.960 --> 00:15:03.690
...was a birthday present I got from your mother.

00:15:06.470 --> 00:15:11.510
But from now on it's a birthday present
from both you and your mother.

00:15:14.020 --> 00:15:15.510
Me too, me too!

00:15:16.820 --> 00:15:17.890
I guess so.

00:15:18.430 --> 00:15:20.490
Both of you, thank you.

00:15:26.830 --> 00:15:30.880
It's time to say goodbye to this room full of memories.

00:15:34.090 --> 00:15:36.090
Daddy, Mommy...

00:15:36.810 --> 00:15:38.830
This may be goodbye to this room...

00:15:39.300 --> 00:15:42.410
...but I'll definitely come home to it someday.

00:15:44.870 --> 00:15:45.840
Daddy...

00:15:46.570 --> 00:15:47.740
Mommy...

00:15:47.960 --> 00:15:49.090
Wait!

00:15:54.190 --> 00:15:55.570
Luna, are you okay?

00:15:58.120 --> 00:15:58.870
Bell...

00:15:59.140 --> 00:16:02.790
Oh yeah, we fell down that waterfall...

00:16:09.660 --> 00:16:10.560
My backpack!

00:16:13.070 --> 00:16:15.130
It's right here. Here.

00:16:15.790 --> 00:16:18.560
Luckily, it caught on a rock.

00:16:19.440 --> 00:16:20.830
I'm so glad!

00:16:21.820 --> 00:16:24.130
It must be a very precious backpack.

00:16:26.010 --> 00:16:27.540
Thank you, Bell.

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:30.840
Where are we?

00:16:40.870 --> 00:16:42.750
What a huge forest...

00:16:43.840 --> 00:16:47.620
Hey!

00:16:47.770 --> 00:16:49.590
Are you okay?

00:16:50.460 --> 00:16:51.940
We're fine!

00:16:53.270 --> 00:16:54.770
I'll be down in a second!

00:17:00.260 --> 00:17:02.010
What's up with this forest?

00:17:02.570 --> 00:17:03.620
I don't know.

00:17:03.620 --> 00:17:05.720
Anything and everything is too big.

00:17:06.280 --> 00:17:08.980
Anyways, for the time being let's follow the river.

00:17:10.350 --> 00:17:11.550
You still plan to go?

00:17:12.090 --> 00:17:12.640
Yes.

00:17:13.540 --> 00:17:15.430
Are you thinking at all?

00:17:16.200 --> 00:17:18.790
We don't know what kind of
monsters might jump out.

00:17:19.330 --> 00:17:21.060
That may be true...

00:17:21.450 --> 00:17:23.940
Then, Howard, why don't you wait here?

00:17:24.280 --> 00:17:25.140
What?

00:17:26.310 --> 00:17:29.380
You... think I'm afraid, don't you?

00:17:29.700 --> 00:17:31.560
No, that's not what I...

00:17:31.650 --> 00:17:34.240
Fine. Well, we'd better get moving. Let's go!

00:18:00.840 --> 00:18:03.430
But at any rate, these are huge trees.

00:18:05.360 --> 00:18:06.220
What was that?

00:18:06.790 --> 00:18:08.040
A beetle?

00:18:08.530 --> 00:18:09.620
Over here, too!

00:18:14.100 --> 00:18:15.860
They're a little creepy.

00:18:18.710 --> 00:18:21.340
The insects in this forest are huge.

00:18:22.740 --> 00:18:26.530
Wait a minute. That means there
might still be huge animals?

00:18:28.650 --> 00:18:30.020
Hey, don't tell me...

00:19:05.320 --> 00:19:06.410
Stay away!

00:19:06.410 --> 00:19:07.200
Stop that!

00:19:09.840 --> 00:19:10.540
It bounced off...

00:19:27.070 --> 00:19:29.660
Help me! Papa!

00:19:34.820 --> 00:19:35.740
Let's run for it!

00:19:38.720 --> 00:19:39.450
It's here!

00:19:39.620 --> 00:19:41.740
Just a little closer and I could have killed it!

00:19:42.170 --> 00:19:45.410
It's like this because you shot
even though I told you to stop!

00:19:45.410 --> 00:19:48.190
But if it had been on target,
that much power could have killed it!

00:19:48.390 --> 00:19:51.640
Yeah, that last arrow definitely had a lot of power!

00:19:51.640 --> 00:19:53.980
Yeesh! Bell, even you're saying that!

00:19:55.440 --> 00:19:56.910
.thgir eht ot nruT

00:19:59.010 --> 00:19:59.940
This way!

00:20:13.220 --> 00:20:14.790
It's a dead end!

00:20:14.810 --> 00:20:16.030
What was this way?

00:20:20.640 --> 00:20:21.320
Down?

00:20:22.650 --> 00:20:23.620
We're jumping off!

00:20:48.560 --> 00:20:51.040
I'm sick of this lifestyle!

00:21:02.160 --> 00:21:03.710
Seems like we'll be safe here.

00:21:04.820 --> 00:21:07.780
After giant bugs there's a giant boar?

00:21:08.060 --> 00:21:09.560
This forest is definitely weird!

00:21:09.880 --> 00:21:10.990
That's certainly true.

00:21:11.620 --> 00:21:15.640
And when we jumped down the cliff,
I felt as though my body had become lighter.

00:21:16.910 --> 00:21:18.280
I thought so as well.

00:21:19.030 --> 00:21:21.940
What's going on in this forest?

00:21:22.760 --> 00:21:24.840
Oh yeah. Howard, here.

00:21:25.760 --> 00:21:29.010
You almost left it in front on the boar.

00:21:31.500 --> 00:21:32.700
It's none of your business!

00:21:32.700 --> 00:21:35.250
Howard, you shouldn't speak that way!

00:21:36.070 --> 00:21:40.070
In your hearts, both of you think I'm a coward.

00:21:41.760 --> 00:21:42.730
That's not...

00:21:44.400 --> 00:21:47.530
I'm just a coward who can't fire a bow!

00:21:49.390 --> 00:21:51.150
Anyways, it'll be dark soon.

00:21:51.520 --> 00:21:54.810
Let's look for somewhere nearby
where we can camp out.

00:22:05.920 --> 00:22:06.790
I'm home.

00:22:07.030 --> 00:22:08.060
Welcome back.

00:22:20.040 --> 00:22:22.310
The communications equipment?
Want I should help too?

00:22:22.440 --> 00:22:23.610
I'll do it by myself.

00:22:43.500 --> 00:22:46.870
Maybe deep in this forest, there'll be an answer.

00:23:02.740 --> 00:23:06.520
The eastern woods is more than we imagined.

00:23:06.730 --> 00:23:12.510
Sure is. It's full 'a big trees 'n giant
monsters come out -- it ain't a place I'd like to go.

00:23:12.840 --> 00:23:17.420
But as long as that voice keeps calling out to me,
I feel like I have to keep going.

00:23:17.660 --> 00:23:20.980
I wonder where the person who
goes with that voice is.

00:23:21.110 --> 00:23:24.040
Wait for us. We'll struggle on until we get there.

00:23:25.310 --> 00:23:28.420
Next time:
A forest where anything and everything is big.
